re para siempre.", "words": [[0, 67615], [3, 67718], [12, 68151], [15, 68585], [22, 69018], [27, 69238], [32, 69918], [36, 70058], [41, 70398], [44, 70638], [53, 71719], [55, 72284], [67, 72849], [70, 72989], [77, 73429], [82, 73729]]}, {"verse": 13, "start": 74963, "end": 80785, "text": "Porque tu misericordia es grande para conmigo; y has librado mi alma del hoyo profundo.", "words": [[0, 74963], [7, 75165], [10, 75365], [23, 76205], [26, 76385], [33, 76925], [38, 77225], [47, 78187], [49, 78287], [53, 78387], [61, 78887], [64, 79087], [69, 79347], [73, 79627], [78, 79967]]}, {"verse": 14, "start": 81135, "end": 90163, "text": "Oh Dios, soberbios se levantaron contra mí, y conspiración de fuertes ha buscado mi alma, y no te pusieron delante de sí.", "words": [[0, 81357], [3, 81617], [9, 81877], [19, 82637], [22, 82897], [33, 83657], [40, 84137], [44, 84877], [46, 85077], [59, 85957], [62, 86137], [70, 86757], [73, 86897], [81, 87377], [84, 87617], [90, 88197], [92, 88417], [95, 88537], [98, 88677], [107, 89157], [115, 89617], [118, 89777]]}, {"verse": 15, "start": 90513, "end": 98836, "text": "Mas tú, Señor, Dios misericordioso y clemente, lento para la ira, y grande en misericordia y verdad;", "words": [[0, 90513], [4, 90700], [8, 90880], [15, 91720], [20, 92272], [35, 93245], [37, 93465], [47, 94445], [53, 95045], [58, 95325], [61, 95505], [66, 95925], [68, 96245], [75, 96685], [78, 97025], [91, 98005], [93, 98205]]}, {"verse": 16, "start": 99186, "end": 105980, "text": "Mírame, y ten misericordia de mí: da tu fortaleza a tu siervo, y guarda al hijo de tu sierva.", "words": [[0, 99186], [8, 99767], [10, 100167], [14, 100367], [27, 101207], [30, 101347], [34, 101936], [37, 102140], [40, 102280], [50, 103060], [52, 103200], [55, 103280], [63, 103860], [65, 104320], [72, 104590], [75, 104860], [80, 105100], [83, 105240], [86, 105380]]}, {"verse": 17, "start": 106330, "end": 117238, "text": "Haz conmigo señal para bien, y véanla los que me aborrecen, y sean avergonz